%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec4ba6a512adabf4b8a74985cb2f4d14, type: 3}
  m_Name: JanaIntroDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptedDialogue
  nodes:
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Here, my documents. I had them ready. Jana Sokolova. I live in the
      residential block, end of the second row. Four years now.
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: The dress. I can see you noticed. It's for a ceremony, later. The
      timing's been complicated.
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: What kind of ceremony?
      npcResponse: A wedding. The date's moved several times. I don't remember
        exactly when it started.
      animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    - playerChoiceText: How long have you been wearing it?
      npcResponse: It holds its shape well. I've had it mended in a few places.
        The seamstress on my floor is very kind.
      animationTrigger: TalkIdle
  - type: 0
    npcLine: I work the flower stall on the residential row. Arrangements for
      whatever occasion. Funerals mostly, lately. I come through here every day.
      I know the process.
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: I have a very good memory for procedures. Other things I lose sometimes.
      My permit's here, June expiry. Everything's in order.
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: You seem very familiar with the routine.
      npcResponse: I've been through it many times. The routine is easier than
        the parts in between.
      animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    - playerChoiceText: Do you have someone waiting at home?
      npcResponse: Yes. Soon. He gets home later now. But I wait. I'm very good
        at waiting.
      animationTrigger: TalkIdle
